// A subscriber names one event (`on:`) and the action it runs (`run:`),
// passing the event or its fields. It runs as the application, after the
// booking commits, and each subscriber of an event gets its own delivery.
//
// `retry:` changes its budget from the default 10 attempts within 24
// hours: a repair café closes for the day, so trying for longer is no use.
// Each wait is longer than the last, with random jitter, so many waiting
// deliveries don't all try again together.

use cafe/actions { send_to_bench }
use cafe/events { RepairBooked }

/// Finds each booked repair a bench.
subscriber find_a_bench {
    on: RepairBooked
    run: send_to_bench(event.repair_id, event.item)
    retry: {
        attempts: 6
        within: 4h
    }
}
